258
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:27,700
Morning, Yukiya.

259
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:35,790
That face...

260
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:39,800
Did your heart skip a beat 
seeing my summer uniform?

261
00:20:42,430 --> 00:20:48,020
And you must have been 
stunned by my summer clothes.

262
00:20:55,980 --> 00:20:58,370
I can smell your sweat.

263
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:00,970
Did that get you?

264
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:03,330
You say that,

265
00:21:03,330 --> 00:21:07,580
but I bet you're clinging to me 
because you want me to hug you again.

266
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:12,910
Well? Did that get your heart going?

267
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:13,950
Not really.

268
00:21:13,950 --> 00:21:15,430
You're sweating.

269
00:21:15,430 --> 00:21:17,090
So are you.

270
00:21:17,660 --> 00:21:18,890
Hey,

271
00:21:19,790 --> 00:21:21,340
aren't you going to be late?

272
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:26,320
You wasted time sticking to me, 
and now we're late!

273
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:29,160
It's because you're being so slow!

274
00:21:42,570 --> 00:21:45,330
<i>We've grown up just a little.</i>

275
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,710
<i>And this is the beginning 
of our unforgettable summer.</i>

276
00:23:24,970 --> 00:23:40,240
