My Childhood Friend and the Student Council President

277
00:23:26,190 --> 00:23:27,060
Yukiya.

278
00:23:27,060 --> 00:23:27,630
Yeah?

279
00:23:27,630 --> 00:23:30,030
Do you know what the student 
council president does?

280
00:23:30,030 --> 00:23:31,460
Why do you ask?

281
00:23:31,460 --> 00:23:32,970
The class rep is...

282
00:23:32,970 --> 00:23:35,460
So the student council president 
shows up in the next episode. Got it.

